"no_speech": 0.31
},
{
"start": 1495.5,
"end": 1512.5,
"text": "and paper mills, and lumber, they don't have to go next to it, and then they'll have a lot of central value, right?",
"conf": -0.76,
"no_speech": 0.43
},
{
"start": 1512.5,
"end": 1526.0,
"text": "what do we have",
